| **post-processing** | Runs inside `photon_tracer`; receives HDR float3 from integrator | `PostFxParams`, bloom/firefly/tonemap config |
| **quality** | `ppt_diagnose` analyzes renderer output EXR + render_log | Convergence rate α, artifact types, corrections → `RenderConfig` |
| **scene-analysis** | `ppt_analyze` produces `SceneProfile` → `apply_scene_profile()` → `RenderConfig` | `SceneProfile`, `LightingType`, material census |
| **orchestrator** | Coordinates `ppt_analyze → photon_tracer → ppt_diagnose` pipeline | Config override cascade, gate checks |
| **test-harness** | Furnace / reciprocity / chi-squared tests validate renderer correctness | `TestCounters`, `ConvergenceBaseline`, reference scenes |

